 ('Pottery studio',[('Teacher','Why do we wax the foot?','Por que passamos cera no pé?'),('Student','So it does not fuse to the shelf.','Para que não cole na prateleira.'),('Teacher','And when can we open the kiln?','E quando podemos abrir o forno?'),('Student','Never above 200 degrees.','Nunca acima de 200 graus.')]),
 [('Give a safety warning.','Avise.','Never open the kiln above 200 degrees.'),('Give a step with a reason.','Explique.','Wipe the pot so the glaze does not crawl.'),('Give a limit.','Dê um limite.','Heat it no faster than 100 degrees an hour.')],
