 ('Doctoral seminar',[('Student','Does the article prove that petitioners adapted?','O artigo prova que os peticionários se adaptaram?'),('Supervisor','No, it suggests it, though it cannot prove it.','Não, sugere, embora não possa provar.'),('Student','What is its main contribution?','Qual é sua principal contribuição?'),('Supervisor','It reads the silences as evidence.','Lê os silêncios como evidência.')]),
 [('Summarise a thesis in one sentence.','Resuma.','The article argues that silences in the archive are themselves evidence.'),('Add a cautious qualification.','Acrescente.','The data suggest, though they do not prove, a link.'),('Name a limitation.','Cite.','Further research is needed on private papers.')],
 ('Write a 6-sentence abstract for an imaginary article in the humanities, including a thesis, a source, a caution and a limit.','This article examines how nineteenth-century railway timetables shaped local identity. Drawing on station archives and passenger letters, it argues that punctuality became a civic virtue. The evidence suggests, though it does not prove, that rural towns resisted standard time longer than cities. The study contributes to work on infrastructure and everyday life. It cautions against assuming uniform adoption. Further research is needed on women’s travel diaries.',['Usei **argues**','Usei **suggests, though…**','Indiquei **um limite**'],'6 frases'),
